        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Build a prompt by injecting context into a template string. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Steps performed:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Select chunks that fit within <computeroutput>config_.max_context_length</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Assemble the context block (header + chunks + footer).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Replace <computeroutput>config_.template_placeholder</computeroutput> in <computeroutput>base_template</computeroutput> with the context block.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Replace <computeroutput>{query}</computeroutput> in the result with <computeroutput>query</computeroutput> (if present).</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>base_template</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Template string; must contain <computeroutput>config_.template_placeholder</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The user query (substituted for <computeroutput>{query}</computeroutput>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>chunks</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Candidate retrieved chunks. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The assembled prompt string. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
