    <briefdescription>
<para>Builds RAG prompts by injecting retrieved context into templates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage – template injection: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_r_a_g_prompt_builder_1a52586ad245fc8a2744d8e6b47e347604" kindref="member">RAGPromptBuilder</ref><sp/>builder;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::string<sp/>prompt<sp/>=<sp/>builder.build(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Answer<sp/>based<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>following:\n{context}\n\nQuestion:<sp/>{query}&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>user_question,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>retrieved_chunks);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Usage – full prompt assembly: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">std::string<sp/>prompt<sp/>=<sp/>builder.buildFullPrompt(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;You<sp/>are<sp/>a<sp/>helpful<sp/>legal<sp/>assistant.&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>user_question,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>retrieved_chunks);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
